	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas nunc recepi literas summo mane scriptas 6. huius mensis, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et quia posta festinabat reditum, sine meis literis dimittere nolui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Quod scribis de <persName>Frolichio</persName>, non omnino temere est; nam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>si durasset in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> tumultus, parvum numerum potuissem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>mittere ad augendam gardiam, ut vocant, regis, nec ullus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>est, quem vellet rex in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetia</placeName> colligere militem nisi me <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>authore.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed non erit opus, spero, et omnia sedabuntur <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>regis <placeName ref="l1209">Navarre</placeName> adventu, nuncque quietiora sunt omnia.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dominorum magistratusque amplissimi responso non sum valde sollicitus; <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>omnia enim iusta, honesta, amica, laudabilia et pacata ab iis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>expecto et tanquam ad asillum tutissimum ad eos vellem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>confugere et portum ab aliorum fluctibus et querelis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Illis semper <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>benedicat dominus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De <persName>Sanlaurentiano</persName> quod scire cupis, semper <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>est <placeName ref="l546">Vienne</placeName> et sequetur imperatorem, sed non in solennibus; nam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>controversia est inter eum et <persName>Philippi</persName> legatum, quis primas partes <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tenebit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hoc non male eum habet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Non multum sperat de concilio, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>cum papa velit locum deligere in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Legati <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><persName ref="p8347">regem Gal[licum]</persName> dissuadere voluerunt, ne consilium nationale persequeretur; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sed nihil illos puto profecisse.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quid sequetur, non audeo credere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Commendare debemus negocium domino, qui potentior est Satana <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nec deserit suos, quibus tanta alia contulit beneficia.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Sunt, qui dicant illos ex vallibus <placeName>Pragela</placeName> et <placeName>Engrogna</placeName> in <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l736">Pedemontio</placeName>, qui a tot annis defecerunt a pontifice, se coniuncturos cum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nobili illo de <placeName>Monbrun</placeName>, qui aliquot pape loca occupavit prope <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName>Avinionem</placeName> et duxit uxorem neptem cardinalis <persName>Turnonii</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">C<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ontra eum colligitur miles in <placeName ref="l2772">Delphinatu</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l496">Stutgardiensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>coetu si quid intellexeris, gratissimum erit, si me certiorem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>facias, et aliis rebus, que digne erunt, et omnia officia a me velut <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>tuo iure posces, si quid desideraveris.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Iucundissima fuerunt, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>que de verbi profectu scripsisti; plura indies intelligemus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Hoc mense constitui revocare filium, cum <persName>Fulg</persName> nius abitum paret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Expecto pedagogum pium et doctum ad formandos eius mores.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Eum tibi commendo et me tuis precibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis amicos <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l760">Soluturi</placeName> summo mane 8. octobris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p629">Gognetius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
